andaru (0.4.0~dev-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Development build; the release workflow writes each release's entry.
  * Add explicit metadata-only update checks and optional local recovery preparation.
  * Document manual package/state repair without automatic rollback.
  * Bound recovery metadata/output, reserve package space and reject unsafe state.
  * Allow update checks and recovery preparation while the installed package is held.
  * Add root-local portable ZIP/age backup inspection and saved-store restore.
  * Preserve live networking during compare-and-swap restores and require explicit
    repair of imported unresolved secret references.
  * Add an installed-package backup smoke scenario for both dependency orders.
  * Build with patched Go HTTP request-size handling.

